{
  "screen_id": "language-select",
  "route": "/onboarding/language",
  "title": "言語を選ぶ",
  "layout": "standard",
  "notes": "ENTRY実装(entry-forecast.html R145○)。表示言語(locale=ja/en)を選ぶ独立導線。★2026-08-01是正(カードR0801-9d452f-ui02langsave): 従来この画面はcontinueボタンが遷移のみでlocaleを保存せず、注記は『setup-profileで保存』としていたが、実際のオンボーディング経路(navigation.json: country-select→language-select→terms→home)にsetup-profileは含まれず未保存だった(実測確定・二重保存の懸念は無かった)。country-select.jsonと同型のform+PATCH /api/v1/me/preferencesへ修正し、この画面自身でlocaleを保存する。用意している言語は日本語/英語の2つ(settings-routes.ts locales)。",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "shell",
      "type": "app-shell",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "page",
          "type": "page",
          "children": [
            { "id": "title", "type": "heading", "props": { "text": "表示言語を選ぶ", "level": 1 } },
            { "id": "lead", "type": "text", "props": { "text": "画面の文言を表示する言語です。あとで設定からいつでも変えられます。", "muted": true } },
            {
              "id": "language-form",
              "type": "form",
              "action": { "kind": "api", "method": "PATCH", "path": "/api/v1/me/preferences", "body_from": "language-form" },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "locale",
                  "type": "field",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "segmented",
                    "name": "locale",
                    "label": "言語",
                    "default": "ja",
                    "options": [
                      { "value": "ja", "label": "日本語" },
                      { "value": "en", "label": "English" }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                { "id": "continue", "type": "button", "props": { "label": "続ける", "variant": "primary", "type": "submit" } }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    { "from": "language-form", "to_screen_id": "terms", "label": "言語を保存して規約同意へ" }
  ]
}
